  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Oye, sal de aquí, que me vas a estropear la toma!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004F00790065002C002000730061006C002000640065002000610071007500ED002C00200071007500650020006D006500200076006100730020006100200065007300740072006F00700065006100720020006C006100200074006F006D0061002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Oh! ¿Eso que tienes ahí es un Megaaro?\nEso significa que eres un<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀa gran Entrenador<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀa.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No lo parezco, pero soy un prestigioso director...\nfamosísimo entre los amantes del cine B de nicho.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me gustaría inmortalizar la faceta más cruda de\nlos Pokémon salvajes de esta ciudad, usando<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nsolo mi SmartRotom para un mayor realismo.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 142
    },
    {
      "displayText": "El primero en captar mi atención fue un feroz\nPokémon que atrapa a sus presas y les clava<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nsus afilados colmillos... ¡Carvanha!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 134
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pero... voy a ser sincero. Filmar tan de cerca a los\nPokémon salvajes es tan peligroso...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡¡Me juego la vida!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100A1004D00650020006A007500650067006F0020006C0061002000760069006400610021002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por eso llegué a la sabia conclusión de que\ndebería grabar Pokémon que estén entrenados.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Y ahí es donde entras tú en juego! Si me traes un\nCarvanha, sería un honor para mí hacerlo famoso.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 2024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No podremos empezar a grabar hasta que vengas\ncon un Carvanha en el equipo.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Empezamos de una vez por todas o no?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0045006D00700065007A0061006D006F007300200064006500200075006E0061002000760065007A00200070006F007200200074006F0064006100730020006F0020006E006F003F00100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Qué nervios... Espero hacerlo bien.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0051007500E90020006E0065007200760069006F0073002E002E002E002000450073007000650072006F002000680061006300650072006C006F0020006200690065006E002E00100002011401960000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Qué maravilla! ¿Te molestaría prestarme un rato\na ese Carvanha que tienes ahí?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡De acuerdo!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004400650020006100630075006500720064006F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Y qué gano yo?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF005900200071007500E9002000670061006E006F00200079006F003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Te daré una recompensa! No te preocupes.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100540065002000640061007200E900200075006E00610020007200650063006F006D00700065006E0073006100210020004E006F0020007400650020007000720065006F00630075007000650073002E00100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Ok, todos a sus puestos!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004F006B002C00200074006F0064006F0073002000610020007300750073002000700075006500730074006F0073002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Vamos con la escena del río! Luces, cámara y...\n¡acción!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100560061006D006F007300200063006F006E0020006C006100200065007300630065006E0061002000640065006C0020007200ED006F00210020004C0075006300650073002C0020006300E1006D00610072006100200079002E002E002E000A00A1006100630063006900F3006E002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Cuidado! ¡¡Es un Carvanha!!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004300750069006400610064006F0021002000A100A10045007300200075006E002000430061007200760061006E006800610021002100100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡¡Nos va a comer!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100A1004E006F00730020007600610020006100200063006F006D006500720021002100100002011401960000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nha... nha...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E00680061002E002E002E0020006E00680061002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Corte!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10043006F007200740065002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Tienes que abalanzarte sobre ellos con la boca\nbien abierta, Carvanha! ¡Que se vean los dientes!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Car...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004300610072002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Eh... ¿Señor director? Busqué en internet y...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450068002E002E002E002000BF0053006500F1006F00720020006400690072006500630074006F0072003F00200042007500730071007500E900200065006E00200069006E007400650072006E0065007400200079002E002E002E00100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dice que los Carvanha siempre atacan en grupo,\nporque cuando están solos son muy tímidos.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡¿Cóoomo?! ¡Eso acaba de arruinar toda\nla escena que tenía pensado filmar!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Espera... ¿Un Carvanha al que le dan miedo\nlos humanos y no al revés?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500730070006500720061002E002E002E002000BF0055006E002000430061007200760061006E0068006100200061006C00200071007500650020006C0065002000640061006E0020006D006900650064006F000A006C006F0073002000680075006D0061006E006F0073002000790020006E006F00200061006C002000720065007600E90073003F00100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Hmm! ¡Creo que podría funcionar!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10048006D006D0021002000A1004300720065006F002000710075006500200070006F0064007200ED0061002000660075006E00630069006F006E00610072002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vamos a tener que cambiar un poco el guion,\npero me gusta cómo suena.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 3940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00560061006D006F007300200061002000740065006E006500720020007100750065002000630061006D006200690061007200200075006E00200070006F0063006F00200065006C0020006700750069006F006E002C000A007000650072006F0020006D00650020006700750073007400610020006300F3006D006F0020007300750065006E0061002E00100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un Carvanha le teme a los humanos por culpa\nde su timidez... ¡Esto sí es cine de verdad!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por fin avanzamos un poco.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F0072002000660069006E0020006100760061006E007A0061006D006F007300200075006E00200070006F0063006F002E00100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Los Carvanha son más lindos de lo que pensaba,\nviéndolos de cerca.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006F0073002000430061007200760061006E0068006100200073006F006E0020006D00E100730020006C0069006E0064006F00730020006400650020006C006F0020007100750065002000700065006E0073006100620061002C000A0076006900E9006E0064006F006C006F0073002000640065002000630065007200630061002E00100002011401960000",
